<view class="page safe-bottom">
  <view class="card">
    <textarea
      class="content-input"
      placeholder="分享今天的小事…"
      maxlength="500"
      value="{{content}}"
      bindinput="onContentInput"
      auto-height
    ></textarea>
    <view class="sub char-count">{{content.length}}/500</view>

    <view class="image-grid">
      <view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="image-item">
        <image class="image-thumb" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="previewImage" />
        <view class="image-remove" data-index="{{index}}" catchtap="removeImage">×</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{images.length < 3}}" class="image-item image-add" bindtap="addImage">＋</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    🌿 发布后，文字和图片将公开展示在社区，所有人可见；删除动态时图片会一并删除。宠物私密照片不会自动发布到这里。
  </view>

  <view class="btn-primary publish-btn {{submitting ? 'btn-loading' : ''}}" bindtap="submit">
    {{submitting ? '发布中…' : '发布'}}
  </view>

  <privacy-popup show="{{showPrivacy}}" bindagree="onPrivacyAgree" bindcancel="onPrivacyCancel" />
</view>
